OL,3,CFirefighters tackle major blaze in
OL,4,CSaddleworth Moor
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a major
OL,7,Fblaze in Saddleworth Moor.
OL,9,FThe fire broke out near Holmfirth Road
OL,10,Fin Oldham in the evening on Wednesday
OL,11,F12 August.JPeople have been urged to
OL,12,Favoid the area as crews remain on the
OL,13,Fscene.
OL,15,FIn a statement, the Greater Manchester
OL,16,FFire and Rescue Service posted: "Our
OL,17,Fcrews have been tackling a moorland
OL,18,Ffire near Holmfirth Road in Oldham
OL,19,Fthrough the night.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
