PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786643328
OL,3,CFirefighters tackle major blaze in
OL,4,CSaddleworth Moor
OL,6,F"Firefighters have made good progress
OL,7,Fin extinguishing the fire but remain
OL,8,Fat the scene damping down and
OL,9,Fmonitoring hotspots. Please avoid the
OL,10,Farea while emergency services respond
OL,11,Fto the incident.
OL,13,F"A road closure is in place on
OL,14,FHolmfirth Road in both directions
OL,15,Fbetween Dovestone and Greenfield
OL,16,Freservoirs."
OL,18,FThe blaze comes after wildfires have
OL,19,Fdevastated land in Dovestone and
OL,20,FTintwistle in Greater Manchester
OL,21,Fearlier this summer.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/2
